        "sourceText": "1 tablespoon corn starch"
      }
    ],
    "steps": [
      {
        "text": "1 Melt butter, seasonings and cheese in a double boiler until cheese is soft.  2 Add corn starch to beer and slowly add eggs to mixture. Cook until thick. Serve very hot on toast."
